      "rows": [
        {
          "body": "<strong>Resolved issues recorded.</strong> 7 resolved issues on the Overview tab had no changelog row: v2.0: 7-boolean schema collapsed to two enums — Style (Default/Subtle) × VisualType (Icon/Asset), a clean 2 × 2; v2.0: Duplicate header / header1 booleans merged into a single header frame with #heading + #description; v2.0: color=white/grey blue renamed Style=Default/Subtle, matching the token namespace and dropping the space-in-value; v2.0: Icon placeholder replaced with a real Figma slot, and the flat coloured asset rectangle with an Asset slot wrapping an instance — both swappable; v2.0: Action promoted to a slot too — Action Container holds a canonical Button instance rather than a drawn button; v2.1: Visual slot unified to a single Visual Container across all four variants (was Icon Container / Asset Container); v2.1: visualType recased to VisualType — Title Case, matching the enum convention (Style, Type, State) rather than the boolean camelCase style.",
          "delta": {
            "kind": "resolved",
            "label": "Docs"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
